{"data":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2018576291340149168","created_at":"2026-02-03T06:44:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2018576291340149168"],"id":"2018576291340149168","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":27297,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"怎么办怎么办？ https://t.co/fNfJPG9Pe6","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2018576291340149168"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2018516988545675302","created_at":"2026-02-03T02:48:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2018516988545675302"],"id":"2018516988545675302","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7819,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我不打算生孩子了，我觉得生孩子是一件特别简单的事情，两个一事无成的人鼓捣鼓捣就能生了，但我本身就是个送外卖的，以后找的对象肯定也大差不差，未来孩子出生没办法托举他，既然给不了他好的生活，我不想在让他受一遍我受的苦","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2018516988545675302"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2018335794126344198","created_at":"2026-02-02T14:48:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2018335794126344198"],"id":"2018335794126344198","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":26257,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这个怎么弄呀？ https://t.co/1LOtzYfgyw","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2018335794126344198"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2018285018322501775","created_at":"2026-02-02T11:27:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2018285018322501775"],"id":"2018285018322501775","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7438,"like_count":45,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"跑了外卖才知道\n这是所有工作中\n唯一个没有勾心斗角\n而且特别团结的工作 \n不管和你熟不熟\n不管是不是一个平台\n只要问路问店铺都会告诉你 \n同楼层还会顺便带上去\n有事儿是真帮忙\n这是我见过最干净的一个圈","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2018285018322501775"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2018157021598785826","created_at":"2026-02-02T02:58:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2018157021598785826"],"id":"2018157021598785826","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7164,"like_count":24,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"希望有些顾客能明白，外卖超时不可能都是外卖员的责任，商家卡餐骑手报备也是会延长配送时间的，别一超时就抱怨骑手，让商家美美隐身了是吧？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2018157021598785826"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2017961136944263216","created_at":"2026-02-01T14:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2017961136944263216"],"id":"2017961136944263216","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7763,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":1},"text":"说实话我内心还是很自卑，不敢面对现实，每次送外卖我都会刻意绕开学校或者捂得很严实，很害怕遇到之前同学或者教过我的老师，即使他们不嘲笑我，但谁家好人辍学搞对象？最后恋爱没谈成书也没念成","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2017961136944263216"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2017900766695133545","created_at":"2026-02-01T10:00:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2017900766695133545"],"id":"2017900766695133545","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15383,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"PDD在我卧室装监控了！ https://t.co/LjaZ3pD1fe","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2017900766695133545"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2017799529886847023","created_at":"2026-02-01T03:17:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2017799529886847023"],"id":"2017799529886847023","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6610,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":1},"text":"想到自己流落到送外卖多少有点唏嘘，回想当年，大家都意气风发雄心壮志，觉得都会拥有自己的事业和爱情，如今已不惑之年，泯然众人矣......世事无常啊！","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2017799529886847023"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2017542427855516066","created_at":"2026-01-31T10:16:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2017542427855516066"],"id":"2017542427855516066","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12499,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":1},"text":"老粉丝都知道我之前有一点点小性瘾，有时候折腾一晚上第二天都腰疼，自从经历了搓学、网恋奔现、分手、工作，我现在渐渐的已经戒掉这个坏毛病了，累一天很少有那种想法。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2017542427855516066"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2017490561637487030","created_at":"2026-01-31T06:50:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2017490561637487030"],"id":"2017490561637487030","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":14901,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":1},"text":"也没受伤为什么会突然浮肿？ https://t.co/BdRhkKM1BH","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2017490561637487030"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2017418824774275512","created_at":"2026-01-31T02:05:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2017418824774275512"],"id":"2017418824774275512","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13889,"like_count":56,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我家是开卤肉店的，其实我爸妈一直想让我回去帮忙打理，但我想独立脱离家庭自己生活，一开始尝试过奶茶店、服务员，但都感觉人情世故呀各种麻烦最后又选择了送外卖，目前除了累一点也相对来说自由些，等年后我在考虑学个技术还是去南方试试，实在混不下去了我在回家继承我爸妈的手艺","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2017418824774275512"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2017237789675553037","created_at":"2026-01-30T14:05:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2017237789675553037"],"id":"2017237789675553037","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":40530,"like_count":84,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":1},"text":"谁还没有点黑历史？刚玩x的时候小不懂事，看到其他姐妹拍些果的照片，我就跟风也拍了些擦边照片，越看越羞耻，我前段时间连夜删除了所有大尺度照片","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2017237789675553037"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2017128207393444244","created_at":"2026-01-30T06:50:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2017128207393444244"],"id":"2017128207393444244","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":34899,"like_count":113,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":2},"text":"看新闻了吗？武汉理工的毕业生都在当保安了，可见现在国内大环境有多内卷，突然觉得我中专都没读完就搓学送外卖是对的，可能以后连送外卖都得挤破头","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2017128207393444244"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2017048274453352572","created_at":"2026-01-30T01:32:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2017048274453352572"],"id":"2017048274453352572","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":21641,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":32,"retweet_count":0},"text":"看了半小时没看出来这是几个人 https://t.co/y1lIanK3jK","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2017048274453352572"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2016841552874918320","created_at":"2026-01-29T11:51:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2016841552874918320"],"id":"2016841552874918320","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":17045,"like_count":57,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":0},"text":"抖音记录的送外卖vlog没有流量，不知道是哪个环节出了问题，过几天我准备删完露脸作品在推上公布我的抖音了，想着大家不知道能不能来捧个人场，人情我先欠下了，日后成为大主播我不会忘记你们！","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2016841552874918320"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2016761998894387399","created_at":"2026-01-29T06:35:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2016761998894387399"],"id":"2016761998894387399","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":22330,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":75,"retweet_count":1},"text":"送外卖上午挣的20给她凑路费了 https://t.co/SCqConP0Nx","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2016761998894387399"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2016682635058434362","created_at":"2026-01-29T01:19:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2016682635058434362"],"id":"2016682635058434362","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9441,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":0},"text":"后悔自己当初没好好念书，我就是曾经那个老师让背课文，我视老师为仇人的那个不爱学习的差生，现在好了学没上成搓学送外卖了，感觉人生一眼看到头的黑暗，奉劝同龄人能多读书尽量多读，希望我是你们的反面教材","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2016682635058434362"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2016473094525948325","created_at":"2026-01-28T11:27:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2016473094525948325"],"id":"2016473094525948325","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":19879,"like_count":77,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":54,"retweet_count":1},"text":"求帮我看一下，为什么我背后的骨头是这样的？ https://t.co/CGitpRWXvn","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2016473094525948325"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2016398362048856390","created_at":"2026-01-28T06:30:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2016398362048856390"],"id":"2016398362048856390","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":17820,"like_count":87,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":1},"text":"外卖员是我认为最勤快、最有趣、工作时间最长，也是最危险的工作，我能想到的差不多的就是农民工了，但工资还很低","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2016398362048856390"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2016162351133909451","created_at":"2026-01-27T14:52:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2016162351133909451"],"id":"2016162351133909451","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26901,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":1},"text":"下班回家饿了一天，刚烧了一锅水准备煮点饭吃，才发现家里饺子没了，面条没了汤圆没了，鸡蛋也没了😞 https://t.co/y4qko5cn5o","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2016162351133909451"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2016092616807612558","created_at":"2026-01-27T10:15:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2016092616807612558"],"id":"2016092616807612558","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":14491,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":39,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我妈怕我不读书学坏了，非要年后拉着我相亲，你们觉得是送外卖苦，还是没有爱情的婚姻苦？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2016092616807612558"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2015954392860836059","created_at":"2026-01-27T01:05:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2015954392860836059"],"id":"2015954392860836059","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":62883,"like_count":111,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":54,"retweet_count":1},"text":"真好奇，我发现晚上送外卖有好多小区都看不清单元号，其他外卖员是怎么那么快找到单元楼的？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2015954392860836059"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2015797456555114977","created_at":"2026-01-26T14:42:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2015797456555114977"],"id":"2015797456555114977","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":25826,"like_count":42,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我过的很幸福但有点后悔遇见你... https://t.co/G3CvMPgDEd","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2015797456555114977"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2015742375965114849","created_at":"2026-01-26T11:03:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2015742375965114849"],"id":"2015742375965114849","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":15543,"like_count":70,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":1},"text":"只有送过外卖的才知道手机是不会熄屏的，充电器是一直插着的，吃饭是不会按时的，上厕所是抽空去的，不被理解是很正常的，如果不是为了生活谁会为了几块钱闯红灯、逆行用生命去赚这个钱","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2015742375965114849"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2015680990040264999","created_at":"2026-01-26T06:59:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2015680990040264999"],"id":"2015680990040264999","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":25119,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"吐了送外卖撞见京东快递员在楼梯撒尿！ https://t.co/HAgyf5BLzL","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2015680990040264999"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1880947070837964800","name":"瑶瑶睡不着💤","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2075590220117094400/Lvbru8uj_normal.jpg","username":"Guillermin45548","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2018576291340149168","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juebjce6f4cch55qmpvm94usj3yzr1","oldest_id":"2015680990040264999","result_count":25}}